    \resumeItem{Flagged post-release issues by reproducing bugs, identifying root causes, and delivering fixes through the standard workflow, using Sentry to confirm stability improvements that enhance user experience.}
  \resumeItemListEnd

\resumeSubheading
  {Machine Learning Research Intern}{May 2023 -- December 2023}
  {Indian Institute of Technology, Indore}{Indore, India}
  \resumeItemListStart
    \resumeItem{Reviewed technical discussions and proposed implementation approaches for feature work, using architecture diagrams to align stakeholders and influence product direction, because I clarified data about 2-3 key constraints and tradeoffs.}
    \resumeItem{Scheduled code reviews and enforced engineering best practices during development, using SwiftLint to maintain consistent code style, improve maintainability, and ensure reliable integration with existing iOS systems.}
    \resumeItem{Coded reusable Kotlin frontend components at IIT Indore for interactive UI flows, which managed state transitions reliably and kept architecture maintainable, so about ~25\% more dashboard views were easier to extend and maintain.}
  \resumeItemListEnd

